    },
    "items": [
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "O give thanks unto the LORD; call upon his name:",
          "Make known his deeds among the people."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Sing unto him, sing psalms unto him:",
          "Talk ye of all his wondrous works."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Glory ye in his holy name:",
          "Let the heart of them rejoice that seek the LORD."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Seek the LORD, and his strength:",
          "Seek his face evermore."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Remember his marvellous works that he hath done;",
          "His wonders, and the judgments of his mouth;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "O ye seed of Abraham his servant,",
          "Ye children of Jacob his chosen."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He is the LORD our God:",
          "His judgments are in all the earth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He hath remembered his covenant for ever,",
          "The word which he commanded to a thousand generations."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Which covenant he made with Abraham,",
          "And his oath unto Isaac;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "And confirmed the same unto Jacob for a law,",
          "And to Israel for an everlasting covenant:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Saying, Unto thee will I give the land of Canaan,",
          "The lot of your inheritance:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When they were but a few men in number;",
          "Yea, very few, and strangers in it."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When they went from one nation to another,",
          "From one kingdom to another people;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He suffered no man to do them wrong:",
          "Yea, he reproved kings for their sakes;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Saying, Touch not mine anointed,",
          "And do my prophets no harm."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Moreover he called for a famine upon the land:",
          "He brake the whole staff of bread."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He sent a man before them,",
          "Even Joseph, who was sold for a servant:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Whose feet they hurt with fetters:",
          "He was laid in iron:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Until the time that his word came:",
          "The word of the LORD tried him."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The king sent and loosed him;",
          "Even the ruler of the people, and let him go free."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He made him lord of his house,",
          "And ruler of all his substance:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "To bind his princes at his pleasure;",
          "And teach his senators wisdom."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Israel also came into Egypt;",
          "And Jacob sojourned in the land of Ham."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
          "And he increased his people greatly;",
          "And made them stronger than their enemies."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          25
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He turned their heart to hate his people,",
          "To deal subtilly with his servants."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          26
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He sent Moses his servant;",
          "And Aaron whom he had chosen."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          27
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They shewed his signs among them,",
          "And wonders in the land of Ham."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          28
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He sent darkness, and made it dark;",
          "And they rebelled not against his word."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          29
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He turned their waters into blood,",
          "And slew their fish."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          30
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Their land brought forth frogs in abundance,",
          "In the chambers of their kings."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          31
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He spake, and there came divers sorts of flies,",
          "And lice in all their coasts."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          32
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He gave them hail for rain,",
          "And flaming fire in their land."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          33
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He smote their vines also and their fig trees;",
          "And brake the trees of their coasts."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          34
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He spake, and the locusts came, and caterpillers, and that without number,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          35
        ],
        "lines": [
          "And did eat up all the herbs in their land, and devoured the fruit of their ground."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          36
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He smote also all the firstborn in their land,",
          "The chief of all their strength."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          37
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He brought them forth also with silver and gold:",
          "And there was not one feeble person among their tribes."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          38
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Egypt was glad when they departed:",
          "For the fear of them fell upon them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          39
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He spread a cloud for a covering;",
          "And fire to give light in the night."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          40
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The people asked, and he brought quails,",
          "And satisfied them with the bread of heaven."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          41
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He opened the rock, and the waters gushed out;",
          "They ran in the dry places like a river."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          42
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For he remembered his holy promise,",
          "And Abraham his servant."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          43
        ],
        "lines": [
          "And he brought forth his people with joy,",
          "And his chosen with gladness:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          44
        ],
        "lines": [
          "And gave them the lands of the heathen:",
          "And they inherited the labour of the people;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          45
        ],
        "lines": [
          "That they might observe his statutes,",
          "And keep his laws.",
          "Praise ye the LORD."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
